"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkcasbin_website||=[]).push([[3553],{6145(n){n.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-11-01-aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-11-01-aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin.md","title":"C\xe1ch AWS s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Apache Casbin trong H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng Qu\u1ea3n l\xfd T\xe0i s\u1ea3n H\xecnh \u1ea3nh","description":"H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng Qu\u1ea3n l\xfd T\xe0i s\u1ea3n H\xecnh \u1ea3nh m\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf c\u1ee7a AWS s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng pycasbin cho m\xf4 h\xecnh quy\u1ec1n ABAC/RBAC hai l\u1edbp, t\u1eeb ki\u1ec3m tra route API \u0111\u1ebfn truy c\u1eadp c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng.","date":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/casbin"},{"inline":true,"label":"aws","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/aws"},{"inline":true,"label":"abac","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/abac"},{"inline":true,"label":"rbac","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/rbac"},{"inline":true,"label":"adopters","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/adopters"}],"readingTime":2.83,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Creator of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/hsluoyz.png","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"C\xe1ch AWS s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Apache Casbin trong H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng Qu\u1ea3n l\xfd T\xe0i s\u1ea3n H\xecnh \u1ea3nh","description":"H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng Qu\u1ea3n l\xfd T\xe0i s\u1ea3n H\xecnh \u1ea3nh m\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf c\u1ee7a AWS s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng pycasbin cho m\xf4 h\xecnh quy\u1ec1n ABAC/RBAC hai l\u1edbp, t\u1eeb ki\u1ec3m tra route API \u0111\u1ebfn truy c\u1eadp c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng.","slug":"aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin","authors":["hsluoyz"],"tags":["casbin","aws","abac","rbac","adopters"]},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"N\xe2ng c\u1ea5p Casbin (Go) t\u1eeb v2 l\xean v3: H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn di chuy\u1ec3n to\xe0n di\u1ec7n","permalink":"/vi/blog/upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3"}},"content":"[AWS Visual Asset Management System (VAMS)](https://github.com/awslabs/visual-asset-management-system) l\xe0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf c\u1ee7a AWS \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3n l\xfd v\xe0 ph\xe2n ph\u1ed1i t\xe0i s\u1ea3n h\xecnh \u1ea3nh cho AI v\u1eadt l\xfd. Khi AWS ra m\u1eaft VAMS 2.0, h\u1ecd \u0111\xe3 thay th\u1ebf c\xe1c nh\xf3m Cognito b\u1eb1ng h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng quy\u1ec1n ABAC/RBAC d\u1ef1a tr\xean Casbin. Phi\xean b\u1ea3n [2.6](https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/physical-ai/visual-asset-management-system-2-6-release/) v\u1eeba c\xf4ng b\u1ed1 g\u1ea7n \u0111\xe2y gi\u1eef nguy\xean thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\xf3 v\xe0 b\u1ed5 sung m\u1ed9t tr\xecnh \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n API t\u1eadp trung ph\xeda tr\xean.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\n## Hai l\u1edbp, m\u1ed9t enforcer {#two-tiers-one-enforcer}\\n\\nVAMS ki\u1ec3m tra m\u1ecdi y\xeau c\u1ea7u API so v\u1edbi hai l\u1edbp \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp. L\u1edbp 1 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh xem vai tr\xf2 c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng c\xf3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe9p g\u1ecdi endpoint hay kh\xf4ng, b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch so s\xe1nh ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c HTTP v\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn route. L\u1edbp 2 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh xem vai tr\xf2 \u0111\xf3 c\xf3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe9p thao t\xe1c tr\xean \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 hay kh\xf4ng, b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch so s\xe1nh ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c v\u1edbi c\xe1c thu\u1ed9c t\xednh th\u1ef1c th\u1ec3 nh\u01b0 `databaseId`, `assetName` v\xe0 `tags`. C\u1ea3 hai l\u1edbp ph\u1ea3i cho ph\xe9p y\xeau c\u1ea7u. N\u1ebfu m\u1ed9t trong hai l\u1edbp t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i, cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi s\u1ebd b\u1ecb lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf.\\n\\nBackend s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng [pycasbin](https://github.com/casbin/pycasbin). M\u1ed7i ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng c\xf3 m\u1ed9t `CasbinEnforcer` bao b\u1ecdc m\u1ed9t `FastEnforcer` \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\xe2y d\u1ef1ng t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t m\xf4 h\xecnh trong b\u1ed9 nh\u1edb v\xe0 m\u1ed9t string adapter. Policy \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p t\u1ea1i runtime t\u1eeb c\xe1c vai tr\xf2 v\xe0 r\xe0ng bu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u tr\u1eef trong DynamoDB v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cache theo t\u1eebng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng trong 60 gi\xe2y. N\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 l\u1ea5y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c policy, enforcer s\u1ebd quay l\u1ea1i policy deny-all thay v\xec fail open.\\n\\nMatcher c\u1ee7a m\xf4 h\xecnh l\xe0 `g(r.sub, p.sub) && eval(p.obj_rule) && r.act == p.act`, v\xec v\u1eady c\xe1c r\xe0ng bu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a vai tr\xf2 c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ee9a bi\u1ec3u th\u1ee9c c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng cho m\u1ed9t t\xe0i nguy\xean v\xe0 h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng. Li\xean k\u1ebft vai tr\xf2 c\u1ee7a Casbin x\u1eed l\xfd \xe1nh x\u1ea1 t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng sang vai tr\xf2, v\xe0 c\xe1c r\xe0ng bu\u1ed9c cung c\u1ea5p ph\u1ea7n ABAC.\\n\\n## Nh\u1eefng thay \u0111\u1ed5i trong 2.6 {#what-changed-in-26}\\n\\nPhi\xean b\u1ea3n 2.6 b\u1ed5 sung m\u1ed9t tr\xecnh \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n t\u1eadp trung duy nh\u1ea5t cho t\u1ea7ng API, h\u1ee3p nh\u1ea5t logic \u0111a y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 v\xe0 claims v\u1ed1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\xe2y n\u1eb1m trong c\xe1c handler ri\xeang l\u1ebb. N\xf3 c\u0169ng b\u1ed5 sung t\xf9y ch\u1ec9nh n\xe2ng cao cho vai tr\xf2 AWS IAM v\xe0 li\xean \u0111o\xe0n OIDC Cognito. B\u1ea3n th\xe2n m\xf4 h\xecnh \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n kh\xf4ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i: Casbin v\u1eabn \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 hai l\u1edbp, v\xe0 c\xe1c Lambda authorizer t\xf9y ch\u1ec9nh c\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\xeam h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf IP ph\xeda tr\xean.\\n\\nT\xe0i li\u1ec7u VAMS m\xf4 t\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 m\xf4 h\xecnh, c\xe1c lo\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\xe0 tr\u01b0\u1eddng r\xe0ng bu\u1ed9c trong [Permissions Model](https://github.com/awslabs/visual-asset-management-system/blob/main/documentation/docusaurus-site/docs/concepts/permissions-model.md). Ph\u1ea7n tri\u1ec3n khai enforcer n\u1eb1m trong [module authz](https://github.com/awslabs/visual-asset-management-system/blob/main/backend/backend/handlers/authz/__init__.py).\\n\\n## T\xecm hi\u1ec3u th\xeam {#learn-more}\\n\\n- [AWS blog: Visual Asset Management System 2.6 release](https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/physical-ai/visual-asset-management-system-2-6-release/)\\n- [VAMS tr\xean GitHub](https://github.com/awslabs/visual-asset-management-system)\\n- [C\xe1c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c \xe1p d\u1ee5ng Apache Casbin](https://casbin.apache.org/docs/adopters)\\n\\nAWS l\xe0 m\u1ed9t trong nhi\u1ec1u t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Apache Casbin. N\u1ebfu d\u1ef1 \xe1n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Casbin, ch\xfang t\xf4i r\u1ea5t s\u1eb5n l\xf2ng th\xeam n\xf3 v\xe0o danh s\xe1ch adopters."},{"id":"upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-02-01-upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-02-01-upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3.md","title":"N\xe2ng c\u1ea5p Casbin (Go) t\u1eeb v2 l\xean v3: H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn di chuy\u1ec3n to\xe0n di\u1ec7n","description":"N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang ch\u1ea1y Casbin v2 trong m\xf4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng production v\xe0 th\u1eafc m\u1eafc v\u1ec1 l\u1ed9 tr\xecnh n\xe2ng c\u1ea5p l\xean v3, h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn n\xe0y d\xe0nh cho b\u1ea1n. Ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd bao qu\xe1t m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft v\u1ec1 qu\xe1 tr\xecnh chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u nh\u1eefng thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ebfn th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n di chuy\u1ec3n an to\xe0n trong production.","date":"2026-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/casbin"},{"inline":true,"label":"go","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/go"},{"inline":true,"label":"migration","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/migration"},{"inline":true,"label":"upgrade","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/upgrade"},{"inline":true,"label":"v3","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/v-3"}],"readingTime":10.46,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Creator of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/hsluoyz.png","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"N\xe2ng c\u1ea5p Casbin (Go) t\u1eeb v2 l\xean v3: H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn di chuy\u1ec3n to\xe0n di\u1ec7n","slug":"upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3","authors":["hsluoyz"],"tags":["casbin","go","migration","upgrade","v3"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"C\xe1ch AWS s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Apache Casbin trong H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng Qu\u1ea3n l\xfd T\xe0i s\u1ea3n H\xecnh \u1ea3nh","permalink":"/vi/blog/aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin"},"nextItem":{"title":"Casbin n\u0103m 2025: \u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n cho k\u1ef7 nguy\xean AI Agent","permalink":"/vi/blog/casbin-2025-ai-agent-era"}},"content":"N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang ch\u1ea1y Casbin v2 trong m\xf4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng production v\xe0 th\u1eafc m\u1eafc v\u1ec1 l\u1ed9 tr\xecnh n\xe2ng c\u1ea5p l\xean v3, h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn n\xe0y d\xe0nh cho b\u1ea1n. Ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd bao qu\xe1t m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft v\u1ec1 qu\xe1 tr\xecnh chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u nh\u1eefng thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ebfn th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n di chuy\u1ec3n an to\xe0n trong production.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\n## Nh\u1eefng g\xec \u0111\xe3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i trong v3? {#what-changed-in-v3}\\n\\nTin t\u1ed1t l\xe0: **v3 ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu l\xe0 s\u1ef1 thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn module v\u1edbi kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng th\xedch ng\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\xe0n to\xe0n**. Logic \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n c\u1ed1t l\xf5i, API v\xe0 ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng v\u1eabn gi\u1eef nguy\xean. \u0110\xe2y l\xe0 m\u1ed9t quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh c\xf3 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\xedch nh\u1eb1m gi\u1ea3m thi\u1ec3u s\u1ef1 gi\xe1n \u0111o\u1ea1n trong khi tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 c\xe1c quy \u01b0\u1edbc phi\xean b\u1ea3n ng\u1eef ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a Go.\\n\\n### Thay \u0111\u1ed5i ch\xednh: \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn Module {#the-main-change-module-path}\\n\\nThay \u0111\u1ed5i duy nh\u1ea5t g\xe2y h\u1ecfng h\xf3c (breaking change) trong v3 l\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn module Go:\\n\\n```go\\n// v2\\nimport \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v2\\"\\n\\n// v3\\nimport \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\"\\n```\\n\\nCh\u1ec9 v\u1eady th\xf4i. C\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch, m\xf4 h\xecnh v\xe0 logic m\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n hi\u1ec7n c\xf3 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i thay \u0111\u1ed5i. Qu\xe1 tr\xecnh di chuy\u1ec3n mang t\xednh c\u01a1 h\u1ecdc: c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\xe1c c\xe2u l\u1ec7nh import v\xe0 t\u1ec7p go.mod c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.\\n\\n### T\u1ea1i sao ph\xe1t h\xe0nh v3? {#why-release-v3}\\n\\nB\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eafc m\u1eafc t\u1ea1i sao l\u1ea1i ph\xe1t h\xe0nh m\u1ed9t phi\xean b\u1ea3n major m\u1edbi ch\u1ec9 v\xec thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn import. C\xe2u tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi n\u1eb1m \u1edf phi\xean b\u1ea3n ng\u1eef ngh\u0129a (semantic versioning). H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng module c\u1ee7a Go s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ed1 phi\xean b\u1ea3n major trong \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn import (`/v2`, `/v3`, v.v.). \u0110i\u1ec1u n\xe0y cho ph\xe9p nhi\u1ec1u phi\xean b\u1ea3n major c\xf9ng t\u1ed3n t\u1ea1i trong c\xf9ng m\u1ed9t c\xe2y ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c, \u0111i\u1ec1u r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\xe1c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng l\u1edbn c\xf3 nhi\u1ec1u ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c.\\n\\nB\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch ph\xe1t h\xe0nh v3, ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3:\\n- Tu\xe2n th\u1ee7 phi\xean b\u1ea3n import ng\u1eef ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a Go\\n- Cho ph\xe9p di chuy\u1ec3n d\u1ea7n d\u1ea7n trong c\xe1c \u0111\u1ed3 th\u1ecb ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p\\n- T\u1ea1o ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ec1 cho c\xe1c c\u1ea3i ti\u1ebfn trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai m\xe0 kh\xf4ng l\xe0m h\u1ecfng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng v2 hi\u1ec7n c\xf3\\n\\n## Nh\u1eefng g\xec v\u1eabn gi\u1eef nguy\xean? {#what-stayed-the-same}\\n\\nM\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 kh\xe1c. Nghi\xeam t\xfac \u0111\u1ea5y.\\n\\n- **T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c API v\u1eabn gi\u1ed1ng h\u1ec7t nhau** - `Enforce()`, `AddPolicy()`, `GetAllRoles()` v\xe0 m\u1ecdi ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c kh\xe1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng ch\xednh x\xe1c nh\u01b0 tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\xe2y\\n- **C\xfa ph\xe1p m\xf4 h\xecnh v\xe0 ch\xednh s\xe1ch kh\xf4ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i** - C\xe1c t\u1ec7p m\xf4 h\xecnh `.conf` v\xe0 t\u1ec7p ch\xednh s\xe1ch `.csv` hi\u1ec7n c\xf3 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng m\xe0 kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n s\u1eeda \u0111\u1ed5i\\n- **Giao di\u1ec7n Adapter kh\xf4ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i** - C\xe1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c `persist.Adapter` v\u1eabn gi\u1eef nguy\xean; adapters ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3n ph\xe1t h\xe0nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\xe2y d\u1ef1ng d\u1ef1a tr\xean \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn module v3\\n- **\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t** - Kh\xf4ng c\xf3 s\u1ef1 suy gi\u1ea3m hay c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t; \u0111\xf3 v\u1eabn l\xe0 c\xf9ng m\u1ed9t engine\\n- **T\xedch h\u1ee3p Middleware** - Middleware ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng theo c\xe1ch t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 m\u1ed9t khi n\xf3 import c\xf9ng phi\xean b\u1ea3n major v\u1edbi enforcer c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n\\n\\n## T\xednh n\u0103ng m\u1edbi trong v3 {#new-features-in-v3}\\n\\nK\u1ec3 t\u1eeb b\u1ea3n ph\xe1t h\xe0nh v3.0.0 v\xe0o th\xe1ng 12 n\u0103m 2025, m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\xednh n\u0103ng m\u1edbi \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\xeam v\xe0o:\\n\\n### v3.7.0+: T\xedch h\u1ee3p Logger n\xe2ng cao {#v370-enhanced-logger-integration}\\nB\xe2y gi\u1edd b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 t\xedch h\u1ee3p c\xe1c logger t\xf9y ch\u1ec9nh v\xe0o c\xe1c thao t\xe1c th\u1ef1c thi v\xe0 qu\u1ea3n l\xfd ch\xednh s\xe1ch c\u1ed1t l\xf5i c\u1ee7a Casbin, cung c\u1ea5p kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng quan s\xe1t (observability) t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n:\\n\\n```go\\nenforcer.SetLogger(yourCustomLogger)\\n```\\n\\n### v3.8.0+: API GetAllUsers() {#v380-getallusers-api}\\nM\u1ed9t API m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 ph\xe2n bi\u1ec7t ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng v\u1edbi vai tr\xf2:\\n\\n```go\\nusers, err := enforcer.GetAllUsers()\\n```\\n\\n\u0110i\u1ec1u n\xe0y \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t h\u1eefu \xedch trong c\xe1c h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng RBAC khi b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n li\u1ec7t k\xea ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf t\xe1ch bi\u1ec7t kh\u1ecfi c\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a vai tr\xf2.\\n\\n### v3.9.0+: Ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n v\xf2ng l\u1eb7p t\xedch h\u1ee3p s\u1eb5n {#v390-built-in-cycle-detection}\\nEnforcer hi\u1ec7n bao g\u1ed3m vi\u1ec7c t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n c\xe1c v\xf2ng l\u1eb7p trong ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p vai tr\xf2, ng\u0103n ch\u1eb7n c\xe1c v\xf2ng l\u1eb7p v\xf4 h\u1ea1n:\\n\\n```go\\n// Automatically detects and prevents circular role assignments\\nenforcer.AddGroupingPolicy(\\"alice\\", \\"admin\\")\\nenforcer.AddGroupingPolicy(\\"admin\\", \\"alice\\") // Will be detected as a cycle\\n```\\n\\n### v3.10.0+: API Explain() cho c\xe1i nh\xecn s\xe2u s\u1eafc v\u1ec1 \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n b\u1eb1ng AI {#v3100-explain-api-for-ai-powered-authorization-insights}\\nT\xednh n\u0103ng m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\xe1c API LLM \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i th\xedch c\xe1c quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n b\u1eb1ng ng\xf4n ng\u1eef t\u1ef1 nhi\xean:\\n\\n```go\\nenforcer.SetAIConfig(casbin.AIConfig{\\n    Endpoint: \\"https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\\",\\n    APIKey:   os.Getenv(\\"OPENAI_API_KEY\\"),\\n    Model:    \\"gpt-4\\",\\n})\\n\\nexplanation, err := enforcer.Explain(\\"alice\\", \\"data1\\", \\"read\\")\\n// e.g. \\"Alice can read data1 because she has the \'reader\' role...\\"\\n```\\n\\n\u0110i\u1ec1u n\xe0y \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\xf3 gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1ee1 l\u1ed7i c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p v\xe0 gi\xfap c\xe1c b\xean li\xean quan kh\xf4ng chuy\xean m\xf4n k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt hi\u1ec3u r\xf5 c\xe1c quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n.\\n\\n## **Chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c di tr\xfa** {#migration-strategy}\\n\\n### **\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi d\u1ef1 \xe1n m\u1edbi** {#for-new-projects}\\n\\n\u0110\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n: ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v3 ngay t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u.\\n\\n```bash\\ngo get github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\n```\\n\\n```go\\nimport \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\"\\n```\\n\\n### **\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi d\u1ef1 \xe1n v2 hi\u1ec7n c\xf3** {#for-existing-v2-projects}\\n\\nQu\xe1 tr\xecnh di tr\xfa bao g\u1ed3m ba b\u01b0\u1edbc:\\n\\n#### **B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt go.mod c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n** {#step-1-update-your-gomod}\\n\\n```bash\\ngo get github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\ngo mod tidy\\n```\\n\\n#### **B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\xe1c c\xe2u l\u1ec7nh Import** {#step-2-update-import-statements}\\n\\nT\xecm v\xe0 thay th\u1ebf t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c import Casbin trong m\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n:\\n\\n```bash\\n# Using sed on Unix/Linux/Mac\\nfind . -type f -name \'*.go\' -exec sed -i \'s|github.com/casbin/casbin/v2|github.com/casbin/casbin/v3|g\' {} +\\n\\n# Or manually in your editor\\n# Find: github.com/casbin/casbin/v2\\n# Replace: github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\n```\\n\\n#### **B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt import Adapter (n\u1ebfu \xe1p d\u1ee5ng)** {#step-3-update-adapter-imports-if-applicable}\\n\\nM\u1ed9t adapter tri\u1ec3n khai `persist.Adapter` t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t phi\xean b\u1ea3n ch\xednh c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, v\xec `model.Model` trong `casbin/v2` v\xe0 `casbin/v3` l\xe0 c\xe1c ki\u1ec3u Go kh\xe1c nhau. Do \u0111\xf3, m\u1ed9t enforcer v3 c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3n ph\xe1t h\xe0nh adapter nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u `github.com/casbin/casbin/v3`. H\xe3y ki\u1ec3m tra `go.mod` c\u1ee7a adapter:\\n\\n```go\\n// Example: the PostgreSQL adapter already depends on casbin/v3\\nimport pgadapter \\"github.com/apache/casbin-pg-adapter\\"\\n\\n// The file adapter is built in and ships with each major version\\n```\\n\\nN\u1ebfu adapter c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt, h\xe3y ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v2 cho d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\xf3 cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi n\xf3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt, ho\u1eb7c m\u1edf m\u1ed9t issue trong repository c\u1ee7a adapter.\\n\\n### **K\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch ho\xe0n t\xe1c (Rollback)** {#rollback-plan}\\n\\nN\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n ho\xe0n t\xe1c:\\n\\n1. **C\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 m\xe3**: Kh\xf4i ph\u1ee5c c\xe1c thay \u0111\u1ed5i import (s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng qu\u1ea3n l\xfd phi\xean b\u1ea3n)\\n2. **C\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c**: `go get github.com/casbin/casbin/v2@latest`\\n3. **Tri\u1ec3n khai**: S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng quy tr\xecnh tri\u1ec3n khai ti\xeau chu\u1ea9n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 kh\xf4i ph\u1ee5c\\n\\nV\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a qu\xe1 tr\xecnh di tr\xfa n\xe0y n\u1eb1m \u1edf vi\u1ec7c ho\xe0n t\xe1c r\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n - ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n kh\xf4i ph\u1ee5c c\xe1c thay \u0111\u1ed5i import v\xe0 tri\u1ec3n khai l\u1ea1i.\\n\\n## **T\xf4i c\xf3 c\u1ea7n di tr\xfa c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u Policy kh\xf4ng?** {#do-i-need-to-migrate-my-policy-database}\\n\\n**Kh\xf4ng.** D\u1eef li\u1ec7u policy hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn gi\u1eef nguy\xean. C\xe1c policy \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u tr\u1eef d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng chu\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n (subject, object, action, v.v.) v\xe0 kh\xf4ng ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\xe0o phi\xean b\u1ea3n Casbin.\\n\\n## **Ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed qu\xe1 tr\xecnh di tr\xfa c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n** {#testing-your-migration}\\n\\n### **Ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng** {#automated-testing}\\n\\nC\xe1c b\xe0i ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed hi\u1ec7n c\xf3 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n n\xean v\u01b0\u1ee3t qua m\xe0 kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda:\\n\\n```go\\nfunc TestPolicyEnforcement(t *testing.T) {\\n    // This test works identically in v2 and v3\\n    e, _ := casbin.NewEnforcer(\\"model.conf\\", \\"policy.csv\\")\\n    \\n    ok, _ := e.Enforce(\\"alice\\", \\"data1\\", \\"read\\")\\n    if !ok {\\n        t.Error(\\"Expected alice to have read access to data1\\")\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### **Ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed t\xedch h\u1ee3p** {#integration-testing}\\n\\nMiddleware nh\u1eadn v\xe0o m\u1ed9t `*casbin.Enforcer` b\u1ecb r\xe0ng bu\u1ed9c v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t phi\xean b\u1ea3n ch\xednh theo c\xe1ch t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 nh\u01b0 adapters. N\u1ebfu middleware c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn import `casbin/v2`, vi\u1ec7c g\u1ecdi tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp enforcer ch\u1ec9 m\u1ea5t v\xe0i d\xf2ng:\\n\\n```go\\n// Example with Gin\\nimport (\\n    \\"net/http\\"\\n\\n    \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\"\\n    \\"github.com/gin-gonic/gin\\"\\n)\\n\\nfunc Authorizer(e *casbin.Enforcer) gin.HandlerFunc {\\n    return func(c *gin.Context) {\\n        ok, err := e.Enforce(c.GetString(\\"user\\"), c.Request.URL.Path, c.Request.Method)\\n        if err != nil || !ok {\\n            c.AbortWithStatus(http.StatusForbidden)\\n            return\\n        }\\n        c.Next()\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### **Ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed t\u1ea3i (Load Testing)** {#load-testing}\\n\\nCh\u1ea1y c\xe1c b\xe0i ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed t\u1ea3i ti\xeau chu\u1ea9n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\xean b\u1ea3n build v3. \u0110\u1eb7c t\xednh hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t n\xean gi\u1ed1ng h\u1ec7t v2.\\n\\n### **X\xe1c minh Policy** {#policy-verification}\\n\\nSo s\xe1nh \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 policy gi\u1eefa c\xe1c phi\xean b\u1ea3n:\\n\\n```bash\\n# Export policies from v2\\n# Load into v3\\n# Run test cases against both\\n# Compare results\\n```\\n\\nN\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n th\u1ea5y b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 s\u1ef1 kh\xe1c bi\u1ec7t n\xe0o, \u0111\xf3 c\xf3 th\u1ec3 l\xe0 l\u1ed7i - vui l\xf2ng b\xe1o c\xe1o!\\n\\n## **C\xe1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p (Common Pitfalls)** {#common-pitfalls}\\n\\n### **V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 1: H\u1ed7n h\u1ee3p ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v2/v3** {#pitfall-1-mixed-v2v3-dependencies}\\n\\n**V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1**: M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Casbin v2, nh\u1eefng c\xe1i kh\xe1c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v3, g\xe2y ra xung \u0111\u1ed9t.\\n\\n**Gi\u1ea3i ph\xe1p**: B\u1ea3n th\xe2n qu\xe1 tr\xecnh build kh\xf4ng sao c\u1ea3: H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng module c\u1ee7a Go coi v2 v\xe0 v3 l\xe0 c\xe1c g\xf3i ri\xeang bi\u1ec7t, v\xec v\u1eady c\u1ea3 hai \u0111\u1ec1u c\xf3 th\u1ec3 c\xf9ng t\u1ed3n t\u1ea1i trong c\xe2y ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c. \u0110i\u1ec1u b\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 l\xe0m l\xe0 truy\u1ec1n m\u1ed9t enforcer v3 cho m\u1ed9t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n mong \u0111\u1ee3i m\u1ed9t enforcer v2. H\xe3y gi\u1eef cho enforcer, adapter v\xe0 middleware c\u1ee7a n\xf3 c\xf9ng m\u1ed9t phi\xean b\u1ea3n ch\xednh.\\n\\n### **V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 2: Kh\xf4ng kh\u1edbp phi\xean b\u1ea3n Adapter** {#pitfall-2-adapter-version-mismatch}\\n\\n**V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1**: S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng adapter v2 v\u1edbi Casbin v3 (ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea1i).\\n\\n**Gi\u1ea3i ph\xe1p**: L\u1ed7i n\xe0y bi\u1ec3u hi\u1ec7n d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng l\u1ed7i bi\xean d\u1ecbch, kh\xf4ng ph\u1ea3i b\u1ea5t ng\u1edd l\xfac ch\u1ea1y. H\xe3y ki\u1ec3m tra xem phi\xean b\u1ea3n ch\xednh Casbin n\xe0o m\xe0 `go.mod` c\u1ee7a adapter y\xeau c\u1ea7u v\xe0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u1ea3n ph\xe1t h\xe0nh ph\xf9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi enforcer c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.\\n\\n### **V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 3: Qu\xean c\xe1c g\xf3i n\u1ed9i b\u1ed9** {#pitfall-3-forgetting-internal-packages}\\n\\n**V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1**: \u0110\xe3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\xe1c import c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\xednh nh\u01b0ng qu\xean c\xe1c g\xf3i n\u1ed9i b\u1ed9 ho\u1eb7c c\xf4ng c\u1ee5.\\n\\n**Gi\u1ea3i ph\xe1p**: S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng `go mod graph` v\xe0 `go mod why` \u0111\u1ec3 t\xecm t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c Casbin:\\n\\n```bash\\ngo mod graph | grep casbin\\n```\\n\\n### **V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 4: V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 bi\xean d\u1ecbch Adapter t\xf9y ch\u1ec9nh** {#pitfall-4-custom-adapter-compilation-issues}\\n\\n**V\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1**: Custom adapter kh\xf4ng bi\xean d\u1ecbch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c sau khi n\xe2ng c\u1ea5p.\\n\\n**Gi\u1ea3i ph\xe1p**: Giao di\u1ec7n adapter kh\xf4ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i, v\xec v\u1eady \u0111i\u1ec1u n\xe0y cho th\u1ea5y c\xf3 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 import. H\xe3y ki\u1ec3m tra xem t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c import Casbin trong adapter c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec1u s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v3:\\n\\n```go\\nimport (\\n    \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\"\\n    \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3/persist\\"\\n)\\n```\\n\\n## FAQ\\n\\n### H\u1ecfi: v2 v\u1eabn c\xf2n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy tr\xec? {#q-is-v2-still-maintained}\\n\\nT\xednh \u0111\u1ebfn th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m vi\u1ebft b\xe0i, v2 v\u1eabn nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\xe1c b\u1ea3n s\u1eeda l\u1ed7i nghi\xeam tr\u1ecdng, nh\u01b0ng c\xe1c t\xednh n\u0103ng m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n cho v3. H\xe3y l\xean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch di chuy\u1ec3n trong v\xf2ng 6-12 th\xe1ng t\u1edbi.\\n\\n### H\u1ecfi: T\xf4i c\xf3 th\u1ec3 di chuy\u1ec3n d\u1ea7n b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 d\xf9ng v2 v\xe0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\xe1c d\xf9ng v3 kh\xf4ng? {#q-can-i-gradually-migrate-by-having-some-services-on-v2-and-others-on-v3}\\n\\n\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c! Ch\xfang th\u1eadm ch\xed c\xf3 th\u1ec3 chia s\u1ebb c\xf9ng m\u1ed9t c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u policy. \u0110\xe2y l\xe0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng l\u1ee3i \xedch c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u trong v3.\\n\\n### H\u1ecfi: Middleware c\u1ee7a t\xf4i (Gin, Echo, Fiber, v.v.) c\xf3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\xf4ng? {#q-will-my-middleware-gin-echo-fiber-etc-work}\\n\\nCh\u1ec9 khi n\xf3 import c\xf9ng phi\xean b\u1ea3n ch\xednh v\u1edbi enforcer c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Ki\u1ec3m tra `go.mod` c\u1ee7a middleware; n\u1ebfu n\xf3 v\u1eabn \u1edf v2, h\xe3y g\u1ecdi `Enforce()` t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t handler nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a ri\xeang b\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 \u0111\xe3 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u1edf tr\xean.\\n\\n### H\u1ecfi: T\xf4i c\xf3 c\u1ea7n c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\xe1c file model .conf c\u1ee7a m\xecnh kh\xf4ng? {#q-do-i-need-to-update-my-conf-model-files}\\n\\nKh\xf4ng. C\xfa ph\xe1p file Model kh\xf4ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i.\\n\\n### H\u1ecfi: T\xf4i c\xf3 c\u1ea7n c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\xe1c file policy .csv c\u1ee7a m\xecnh kh\xf4ng? {#q-do-i-need-to-update-my-csv-policy-files}\\n\\nKh\xf4ng. \u0110\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng file Policy kh\xf4ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i.\\n\\n### H\u1ecfi: C\xf2n WatcherEx, FilteredAdapter v\xe0 c\xe1c giao di\u1ec7n kh\xe1c th\xec sao? {#q-what-about-watcherex-filteredadapter-and-other-interfaces}\\n\\nT\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c giao di\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec1u kh\xf4ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i. N\u1ebfu m\xe3 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tri\u1ec3n khai c\xe1c giao di\u1ec7n n\xe0y, kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda g\xec th\xeam (ngo\xe0i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn import).\\n\\n### H\u1ecfi: T\xe1c \u0111\u1ed9ng hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t? {#q-performance-impact}\\n\\nKh\xf4ng c\xf3. v3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\xf9ng engine \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 nh\u01b0 v2.\\n\\n### H\u1ecfi: T\xf4i c\xf3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v3 v\u1edbi Go 1.16 kh\xf4ng? {#q-can-i-use-v3-with-go-116}\\n\\nKi\u1ec3m tra go.mod trong kho l\u01b0u tr\u1eef Casbin v3 \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft phi\xean b\u1ea3n Go h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u. Nh\xecn chung, khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng phi\xean b\u1ea3n Go \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t.\\n\\nCh\xfac b\u1ea1n n\xe2ng c\u1ea5p vui v\u1ebb!"},{"id":"casbin-2025-ai-agent-era","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/casbin-2025-ai-agent-era","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2025-12-11-casbin-2025-ai-agent-era.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2025-12-11-casbin-2025-ai-agent-era.md","title":"Casbin n\u0103m 2025: \u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n cho k\u1ef7 nguy\xean AI Agent","description":"2024 l\xe0 n\u0103m m\xe0 c\xe1c AI agent chuy\u1ec3n t\u1eeb demo sang m\xf4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng production. Model Context Protocol (MCP) \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Google, OpenAI, Microsoft v\xe0 nhi\u1ec1u c\xf4ng ty kh\xe1c ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn, v\xe0 c\xe1ch th\u1ee9c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng giao ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi c\xe1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 b\xean ngo\xe0i \u0111ang thay \u0111\u1ed5i. S\u1ef1 thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\xf3 mang \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t lo\u1ea1t c\xe1c th\xe1ch th\u1ee9c m\u1edbi v\u1ec1 \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n m\xe0 \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 Casbin ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111ang t\u1eadp trung gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft.","date":"2025-12-11T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/casbin"},{"inline":true,"label":"roadmap","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/roadmap"},{"inline":true,"label":"AI","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/ai"},{"inline":true,"label":"MCP","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/mcp"},{"inline":true,"label":"edge-computing","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/edge-computing"},{"inline":true,"label":"LLM","permalink":"/vi/blog/tags/llm"}],"readingTime":6.17,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Creator of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/hsluoyz.png","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Casbin n\u0103m 2025: \u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n cho k\u1ef7 nguy\xean AI Agent","slug":"casbin-2025-ai-agent-era","authors":["hsluoyz"],"tags":["casbin","roadmap","AI","MCP","edge-computing","LLM"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"N\xe2ng c\u1ea5p Casbin (Go) t\u1eeb v2 l\xean v3: H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn di chuy\u1ec3n to\xe0n di\u1ec7n","permalink":"/vi/blog/upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3"},"nextItem":{"title":"Hi\u1ec3u chi ti\u1ebft c\xe1ch ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u1edbp c\u1ee7a Casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/2023/12/08/understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail"}},"content":"2024 l\xe0 n\u0103m m\xe0 c\xe1c AI agent chuy\u1ec3n t\u1eeb demo sang m\xf4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng production. Model Context Protocol (MCP) \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Google, OpenAI, Microsoft v\xe0 nhi\u1ec1u c\xf4ng ty kh\xe1c ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn, v\xe0 c\xe1ch th\u1ee9c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng giao ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi c\xe1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 b\xean ngo\xe0i \u0111ang thay \u0111\u1ed5i. S\u1ef1 thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\xf3 mang \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t lo\u1ea1t c\xe1c th\xe1ch th\u1ee9c m\u1edbi v\u1ec1 \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n m\xe0 \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 Casbin ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111ang t\u1eadp trung gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\n## Th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi \u0111\xe3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i {#the-world-has-changed}\\n\\nKhi ch\xfang t\xf4i b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n Casbin v\xe0o n\u0103m 2017, k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n \u0111i\u1ec3n h\xecnh kh\xe1 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n: ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng g\u1eedi y\xeau c\u1ea7u, ch\xfang t\xf4i ki\u1ec3m tra xem h\u1ecd c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n hay kh\xf4ng, xong. C\xf2n ng\xe0y nay? M\u1ed9t AI agent c\xf3 th\u1ec3 h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng thay m\u1eb7t cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng, g\u1ecdi t\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u MCP server, m\u1ed7i server c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp tool ri\xeang, v\xe0 to\xe0n b\u1ed9 qu\xe1 tr\xecnh c\u1ea7n ho\xe0n t\u1ea5t trong v\xe0i mili gi\xe2y t\u1ea1i edge.\\n\\n\u0110\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 MCP hi\u1ec7n ph\xe2n lo\u1ea1i c\xe1c MCP server l\xe0 OAuth 2.0 Resource Server (c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\xe1ng 6 n\u0103m 2025), v\u1edbi c\xe1c scope chi ti\u1ebft nh\u01b0 `mcp:tools:weather` ho\u1eb7c `mcp:resources:customer-data:read`. \u0110\xe2y ch\xednh l\xe0 lo\u1ea1i m\xf4 h\xecnh quy\u1ec1n h\u1ea1n chi ti\u1ebft m\xe0 Casbin \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3; tuy nhi\xean vi\u1ec7c t\xedch h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi MCP v\xe0 OAuth v\u1eabn c\u1ea7n th\xeam n\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c.\\n\\n## Nh\u1eefng g\xec ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111ang th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n {#what-were-working-on}\\n\\n### \u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n cho MCP Server {#mcp-server-authorization}\\n\\n\u0110\xe2y l\xe0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c tr\u1ecdng t\xe2m ch\xednh c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i. Khi m\u1ed9t AI agent g\u1ecdi t\u1edbi m\u1ed9t MCP server, server \u0111\xf3 ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0a ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh: agent n\xe0y, nh\xe2n danh ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng n\xe0y, c\xf3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe9p g\u1ecdi tool n\xe0y v\u1edbi c\xe1c tham s\u1ed1 n\xe0y kh\xf4ng?\\n\\nRBAC truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng l\xe0 kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ee7. B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t c\xe1i g\xec \u0111\xf3 gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 ABAC\u2014v\xed d\u1ee5: \u201cagent n\xe0y c\xf3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe9p truy c\u1eadp d\u1eef li\u1ec7u kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng thu\u1ed9c khu v\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a Alice trong gi\u1edd l\xe0m vi\u1ec7c kh\xf4ng?\u201d Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111ang kh\xe1m ph\xe1 c\xe1ch m\xf4 h\xecnh ch\xednh s\xe1ch c\u1ee7a Casbin c\xf3 th\u1ec3 bi\u1ec3u di\u1ec5n c\xe1c r\xe0ng bu\u1ed9c n\xe0y.\\n\\nTh\xe1ch th\u1ee9c: C\xe1c MCP server ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0a ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh r\u1ea5t nhanh. Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111ang xem x\xe9t vi\u1ec7c \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 ch\xednh s\xe1ch nh\u1eb9 ngay trong ti\u1ebfn tr\xecnh c\u1ee7a MCP server thay v\xec g\u1ecdi t\u1edbi m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n ri\xeang bi\u1ec7t.\\n\\n### \u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n \u01b0u ti\xean Edge {#edge-first-authorization}\\n\\nCloudflare Workers, Deno Deploy, Vercel Edge Functions - kh\xf4ng gian \u0111i\u1ec7n to\xe1n bi\xean \u0111\xe3 b\xf9ng n\u1ed5. V\xe0o n\u0103m 2025, th\u1eddi gian ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i d\u01b0\u1edbi 50ms l\xe0 ti\xeau chu\u1ea9n c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n, v\xe0 b\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecbu \u0111\u1ef1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vi\u1ec7c th\xeam 100ms cho m\u1ed9t b\u01b0\u1edbc ki\u1ec3m tra \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n t\u1edbi m\u1ed9t m\xe1y ch\u1ee7 trung t\xe2m.\\n\\n\u0110i\u1ec1u n\xe0y th\xfac \u0111\u1ea9y ch\xfang t\xf4i suy ngh\u0129 kh\xe1c \u0111i v\u1ec1 c\xe1ch Casbin ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng. Li\u1ec7u ch\xfang ta c\xf3 th\u1ec3 bi\xean d\u1ecbch c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch th\xe0nh WebAssembly v\xe0 ch\u1ea1y tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp trong c\xe1c V8 isolate kh\xf4ng? Li\u1ec7u ch\xfang ta c\xf3 th\u1ec3 cache ch\xednh s\xe1ch th\xf4ng minh t\u1ea1i edge trong khi v\u1eabn duy tr\xec t\xednh nh\u1ea5t qu\xe1n? \u0110\xe2y l\xe0 nh\u1eefng b\xe0i to\xe1n kh\xf3, v\xe0 ch\xfang t\xf4i ch\u01b0a c\xf3 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe2u tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi, nh\u01b0ng \u0111\xf3 l\xe0 h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111i c\u1ee7a t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai.\\n\\nCh\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t quan t\xe2m \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ec7 sinh th\xe1i Cloudflare Workers - h\u1ecd \u0111\xe3 x\xe2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng ho\xe0n ch\u1ec9nh cho c\xe1c MCP server v\u1edbi h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 OAuth t\xedch h\u1ee3p s\u1eb5n. M\u1ed9t t\xedch h\u1ee3p Casbin native t\u1ea1i \u0111\xf3 c\xf3 th\u1ec3 r\u1ea5t m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd.\\n\\n### \u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n cho Pipeline RAG {#rag-pipeline-authorization}\\n\\nM\u1ed9t ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 l\u1eb7p \u0111i l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i: c\xe1c c\xf4ng ty x\xe2y d\u1ef1ng h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng RAG n\u01a1i LLM ph\u1ea3i truy c\u1eadp t\xe0i li\u1ec7u n\u1ed9i b\u1ed9, nh\u01b0ng m\u1ed7i ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng ch\u1ec9 n\xean th\u1ea5y c\xe1c t\xe0i li\u1ec7u m\xe0 h\u1ecd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe9p xem.\\n\\nOWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2025 li\u1ec7t k\xea \u201cSensitive Information Disclosure\u201d (Ti\u1ebft l\u1ed9 th\xf4ng tin nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m) l\xe0 m\u1ed9t r\u1ee7i ro l\u1edbn. Gi\u1ea3i ph\xe1p kh\xf4ng ch\u1ec9 l\xe0 l\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ea7u ra m\xe0 c\xf2n ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o r\u1eb1ng LLM kh\xf4ng bao gi\u1edd truy xu\u1ea5t c\xe1c t\xe0i li\u1ec7u m\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng kh\xf4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp.\\n\\nV\xec v\u1eady, vi\u1ec7c \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n ph\u1ea3i x\u1ea3y ra \u1edf c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 truy v\u1ea5n vector store. Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111ang xem x\xe9t bi\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed5i c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch Casbin th\xe0nh c\xe1c b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc metadata cho vector DB\u2014t\u1ee9c l\xe0 m\u1ed9t b\u01b0\u1edbc ki\u1ec3m tra quy\u1ec1n tr\u1edf th\xe0nh m\u1ed9t m\u1ec7nh \u0111\u1ec1 WHERE \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ea9y xu\u1ed1ng giai \u0111o\u1ea1n truy xu\u1ea5t.\\n\\n### K\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n Multi-Agent {#multi-agent-scenarios}\\n\\nV\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u agent trong m\u1ed9t chu\u1ed7i (v\xed d\u1ee5: coding agent \u2192 deployment agent \u2192 monitoring agent), vi\u1ec7c \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n quy\u1ec1n h\u1ea1n r\u1ea5t ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p. M\u1ed7i agent c\xf3 th\u1ec3 c\xf3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng kh\xe1c nhau, v\xe0 b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i theo d\xf5i to\xe0n b\u1ed9 chu\u1ed7i.\\n\\nLu\u1ed3ng On-Behalf-Of (OBO) c\u1ee7a OAuth bao qu\xe1t m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 n\xe0y, nh\u01b0ng logic cho \u201cagent B c\xf3 th\u1ec3 l\xe0m X nh\xe2n danh agent A nh\xe2n danh user alice\u201d c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t m\xf4 h\xecnh r\xf5 r\xe0ng. Ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p vai tr\xf2 v\xe0 domain RBAC c\u1ee7a Casbin c\xf3 th\u1ec3 m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng sang ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p agent; ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111ang l\xe0m vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ec3 x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ng\u1eef ngh\u0129a.\\n\\n## Nh\u1eefng th\u1ee9 c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n tr\xean l\u1ed9 tr\xecnh truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng {#the-traditional-roadmap-stuff}\\n\\nT\u1ea5t nhi\xean, ch\xfang t\xf4i kh\xf4ng b\u1ecf qu\xean c\xe1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 vi\u1ec7c th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf n\u1eb1m trong danh s\xe1ch c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i:\\n\\n**C\xe1c implementation ng\xf4n ng\u1eef b\u1eaft k\u1ecbp xu h\u01b0\u1edbng** - SwiftCasbin v\xe0 Lua-Casbin v\u1eabn c\xf2n ch\u1eadm h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 t\xednh n\u0103ng so v\u1edbi c\xe1c phi\xean b\u1ea3n Go v\xe0 Node.js. To\xe1n t\u1eed `in`, WatcherEx, caching t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n cho h\xe0m `g` - nh\u1eefng th\u1ee9 n\xe0y c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i nh\u1ea5t qu\xe1n \u1edf m\u1ecdi n\u01a1i.\\n\\n**Middleware cho c\xe1c framework m\u1edbi** - go-zero \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\xeau c\u1ea7u li\xean t\u1ee5c. Poem cho Rust \u0111ang gaining traction (thu h\xfat s\u1ef1 ch\xfa \xfd). Play Framework cho Java \u0111\xe3 n\u1eb1m trong wishlist t\u1eeb l\xe2u.\\n\\n**C\xf4ng vi\u1ec7c v\u1ec1 hi\u1ec7u n\u0103ng** - Khi c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch tr\u1edf n\xean ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p h\u01a1n cho nh\u1eefng use case m\u1edbi n\xe0y, t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 tr\u1edf n\xean quan tr\u1ecdng h\u01a1n. Ch\xfang t\xf4i c\u1ea7n benchmarking, profiling v\xe0 optimization t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n tr\xean t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c implementation.\\n\\n## Nh\u1eefng g\xec ch\xfang t\xf4i ch\u01b0a bi\u1ebft {#what-we-dont-know-yet}\\n\\nL\u0129nh v\u1ef1c \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n cho t\xe1c nh\xe2n AI \u0111ang ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n nhanh ch\xf3ng; ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111ang h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi khi ti\u1ebfn h\xe0nh. C\xe1c c\xe2u h\u1ecfi c\xf2n b\u1ecf ng\u1ecf:\\n\\n- Casbin n\xean c\xf3 c\xe1c nguy\xean th\u1ee7y (primitives) h\u1ea1ng nh\u1ea5t cho \\"danh t\xednh t\xe1c nh\xe2n\\" so v\u1edbi \\"danh t\xednh ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng\\" kh\xf4ng?\\n- B\u1ea1n x\u1eed l\xfd vi\u1ec7c \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n cho c\xe1c c\xf4ng c\u1ee5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\xe1m ph\xe1 \u0111\u1ed9ng th\xf4ng qua MCP nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\xe0o?\\n- Chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c cache ph\xf9 h\u1ee3p l\xe0 g\xec khi ch\xednh s\xe1ch c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\xe0o ng\u1eef c\u1ea3nh th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c?\\n\\nN\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang x\xe2y d\u1ef1ng trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c n\xe0y v\xe0 g\u1eb7p v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n, ch\xfang t\xf4i mu\u1ed1n l\u1eafng nghe t\u1eeb b\u1ea1n. C\xe1c t\xednh n\u0103ng t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t xu\u1ea5t ph\xe1t t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf.\\n\\n## **Getting involved** {#getting-involved}\\n\\nCh\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 l\xe0 m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c GSoC trong nhi\u1ec1u n\u0103m, v\xe0 c\xe1c ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 li\xean quan \u0111\u1ebfn AI n\xe0y r\u1ea5t ph\xf9 h\u1ee3p cho c\xe1c d\u1ef1 \xe1n m\xf9a h\xe8. B\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn GSoC\u2014n\u1ebfu \u0111i\u1ec1u n\xe0y nghe c\xf3 v\u1ebb th\xfa v\u1ecb, h\xe3y li\xean h\u1ec7 tr\xean Discord ho\u1eb7c m\u1edf m\u1ed9t issue tr\xean GitHub.\\n\\nV\xe0i n\u0103m t\u1edbi s\u1ebd v\xf4 c\xf9ng s\xf4i \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n. C\xe1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 tr\u1edf n\xean kh\xf3 kh\u0103n h\u01a1n, nh\u01b0ng c\u0169ng th\xfa v\u1ecb h\u01a1n. Ch\xfang t\xf4i r\u1ea5t h\xe0o h\u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ec3 c\xf9ng nhau gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft ch\xfang."},{"id":"/2023/12/08/understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/2023/12/08/understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2023-12-08-understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2023-12-08-understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail.md","title":"Hi\u1ec3u chi ti\u1ebft c\xe1ch ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u1edbp c\u1ee7a Casbin","description":"B\xe0i vi\u1ebft n\xe0y gi\u1ea3i th\xedch c\xe1ch thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\xe0 tri\u1ec3n khai RBAC b\u1eb1ng th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n Casbin. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\xe1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng SaaS c\xf3 ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p t\xe0i nguy\xean v\xe0 c\xe1c vai tr\xf2 k\u1ebf th\u1eeba quy\u1ec1n, Casbin l\xe0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t cao.","date":"2023-12-08T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":6.8,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Aravinda Kumar","url":"https://github.com/aravindarc","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/aravindarc.png","key":"aravindarc","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Hi\u1ec3u chi ti\u1ebft c\xe1ch ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u1edbp c\u1ee7a Casbin","authors":["aravindarc"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Casbin n\u0103m 2025: \u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n cho k\u1ef7 nguy\xean AI Agent","permalink":"/vi/blog/casbin-2025-ai-agent-era"},"nextItem":{"title":"\u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n trong APISIX s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/2021/08/19/apisix-casbin-authorization"}},"content":"B\xe0i vi\u1ebft n\xe0y gi\u1ea3i th\xedch c\xe1ch thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\xe0 tri\u1ec3n khai RBAC b\u1eb1ng th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n [Casbin](https://casbin.apache.org/). \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\xe1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng SaaS c\xf3 ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p t\xe0i nguy\xean v\xe0 c\xe1c vai tr\xf2 k\u1ebf th\u1eeba quy\u1ec1n, Casbin l\xe0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t cao.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## Gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u v\u1ec1 RBAC {#introduction-to-rbac}\\n\\nRBAC h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf truy c\u1eadp d\u1ef1a tr\xean c\xe1c vai tr\xf2 m\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng n\u1eafm gi\u1eef. \u0110\u1ec3 t\xecm hi\u1ec3u c\xe1ch RBAC **ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p** ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, ch\xfang ta xem x\xe9t RBAC c\u1ee7a Azure v\xe0 sau \u0111\xf3 tri\u1ec3n khai th\u1ee9 g\xec \u0111\xf3 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 trong Casbin.\\n\\n## RBAC ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p c\u1ee7a Azure {#azures-hierarchical-rbac}\\n\\n![Azure Hierarchy](/img/blog/azure-scope-levels.png)\\n\\nTrong Azure, vai tr\xf2 **Owner** \xe1p d\u1ee5ng \u1edf c\xe1c ph\u1ea1m vi kh\xe1c nhau. N\u1ebfu t\xf4i c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n **Owner** \u1edf c\u1ea5p subscription, t\xf4i l\xe0 Owner c\u1ee7a t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c resource group v\xe0 t\xe0i nguy\xean thu\u1ed9c subscription \u0111\xf3. N\u1ebfu t\xf4i c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n Owner \u1edf c\u1ea5p resource group, t\xf4i l\xe0 Owner c\u1ee7a t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 t\xe0i nguy\xean trong nh\xf3m \u0111\xf3.\\n\\nH\xecnh \u1ea3nh d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\xe2y hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp Owner \u1edf c\u1ea5p subscription. ![Subscription Owner](/img/tutorial/subscription-owner.png)\\n\\nKi\u1ec3m tra IAM cho m\u1ed9t resource group thu\u1ed9c subscription \u0111\xf3 s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp Owner \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebf th\u1eeba. ![RG Owner](/img/tutorial/rg-owner.png)\\n\\n\u0110\xf3 l\xe0 c\xe1ch RBAC c\u1ee7a Azure ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng theo ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p. Nhi\u1ec1u h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\xe1c c\u1ea5u tr\xfac ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1. Trong h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn n\xe0y, ch\xfang ta s\u1ebd tri\u1ec3n khai m\u1ed9t m\xf4 h\xecnh t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng b\u1eb1ng Casbin.\\n\\n## C\xe1ch Casbin ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng {#how-casbin-works}\\n\\nVi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u c\xe1c th\xe0nh ph\u1ea7n c\u1ed1t l\xf5i c\u1ee7a Casbin (request, policy, matcher, effect) gi\xfap b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\xe0ng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\xe0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh m\xf4 h\xecnh RBAC h\u01a1n.\\n\\n## ACL l\xe0 g\xec? {#what-is-acl}\\n\\n**ACL (Access Control List)** \xe1nh x\u1ea1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng v\u1edbi c\xe1c h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng v\xe0 h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u1edbi c\xe1c t\xe0i nguy\xean.\\n\\n### \u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a Model {#model-definition}\\n\\nM\u1ed9t m\xf4 h\xecnh ACL t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u:\\n\\n```toml\\n[request_definition]\\nr = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[policy_definition]\\np = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[policy_effect]\\ne = some(where (p.eft == allow))\\n\\n[matchers]\\nm = r.sub == p.sub && r.obj == p.obj && r.act == p.act\\n```\\n\\n1. **request_definition** \u2014 X\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng c\u1ee7a request. V\xed d\u1ee5: `alice, write, data1` c\xf3 ngh\u0129a l\xe0 \u201cAlice c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ghi v\xe0o data1 kh\xf4ng?\u201d\\n2. **policy_definition** \u2014 X\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng c\u1ee7a policy. V\xed d\u1ee5: policy `alice, write, data1` c\u1ea5p cho Alice quy\u1ec1n ghi v\xe0o data1.\\n3. **policy_effect** \u2014 C\xe1ch k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p nhi\u1ec1u policy kh\u1edbp (v\xed d\u1ee5: allow-override).\\n4. **matchers** \u2014 \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n th\u1ecfa m\xe3n: `r.sub == p.sub && r.obj == p.obj && r.act == p.act`.\\n\\n### Th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m trong Casbin editor {#try-it-in-the-casbin-editor}\\n\\nM\u1edf [Casbin editor](https://casbin.org/editor) v\xe0 d\xe1n m\xf4 h\xecnh \u1edf tr\xean v\xe0o tr\xecnh so\u1ea1n th\u1ea3o **Model**.\\n\\nD\xe1n n\u1ed9i dung sau v\xe0o tr\xecnh so\u1ea1n th\u1ea3o **Policy**:\\n\\n```csv\\np, alice, read, data1\\np, bob, write, data2\\n```\\n\\nv\xe0 n\u1ed9i dung sau v\xe0o tr\xecnh so\u1ea1n th\u1ea3o **Request**:\\n\\n```csv\\nalice, read, data1\\n```\\n\\nK\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 s\u1ebd l\xe0:\\n\\n```text\\ntrue\\n```\\n\\n### Bi\u1ec3u di\u1ec5n tr\u1ef1c quan c\u1ee7a m\xf4 h\xecnh ACL, policy v\xe0 vi\u1ec7c kh\u1edbp request {#visual-representation-of-the-acl-model-policy-and-request-matching}\\n\\n![acl](/img/tutorial/acl.png)\\n\\n## RBAC l\xe0 g\xec? {#what-is-rbac}\\n\\n**RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)** g\xe1n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng v\xe0o c\xe1c vai tr\xf2; c\xe1c vai tr\xf2 c\xf3 quy\u1ec1n h\u1ea1n tr\xean c\xe1c t\xe0i nguy\xean. M\u1ed9t request ki\u1ec3m tra xem vai tr\xf2 c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng c\xf3 cho ph\xe9p th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\xean t\xe0i nguy\xean \u0111\xf3 hay kh\xf4ng.\\n\\n### \u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a Model {#model-definition-1}\\n\\nM\u1ed9t m\xf4 h\xecnh RBAC \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n:\\n\\n```toml\\n[request_definition]\\nr = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[policy_definition]\\np = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[role_definition]\\ng = _, _\\ng2 = _, _\\n\\n[policy_effect]\\ne = some(where (p.eft == allow))\\n\\n[matchers]\\nm = r.sub == p.sub && g(p.act, r.act) && r.obj == p.obj\\n```\\n\\n1. **role_definition** \u2014 X\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh c\xe1c quan h\u1ec7 \u0111\u1ed3 th\u1ecb (v\xed d\u1ee5: `g` cho vai tr\xf2-vai tr\xf2 ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng-vai tr\xf2). Matcher s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\xe1c quan h\u1ec7 n\xe0y \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft vai tr\xf2 v\xe0 quy\u1ec1n h\u1ea1n.\\n\\n### Th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m trong Casbin editor {#try-it-in-the-casbin-editor-1}\\n\\nM\u1edf [editor](https://casbin.org/editor) v\xe0 d\xe1n m\xf4 h\xecnh \u1edf tr\xean.\\n\\nD\xe1n n\u1ed9i dung sau v\xe0o tr\xecnh so\u1ea1n th\u1ea3o **Policy**:\\n\\n```csv\\np, alice, reader, data1\\np, bob, owner, data2\\n\\ng, reader, read\\ng, owner, read\\ng, owner, write\\n```\\n\\nv\xe0 n\u1ed9i dung sau v\xe0o tr\xecnh so\u1ea1n th\u1ea3o **Request**:\\n\\n```csv\\nalice, read, data1\\nalice, write, data1\\nbob, write, data2\\nbob, read, data2\\nbob, write, data1\\n```\\n\\nK\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 s\u1ebd l\xe0:\\n\\n```text\\ntrue\\nfalse\\ntrue\\ntrue\\nfalse\\n```\\n\\n### Bi\u1ec3u di\u1ec5n tr\u1ef1c quan c\u1ee7a m\xf4 h\xecnh RBAC, policy v\xe0 vi\u1ec7c kh\u1edbp request {#visual-representation-of-the-rbac-model-policy-and-request-matching}\\n\\n![rbac](/img/tutorial/rbac.png)\\n\\nQuan h\u1ec7 **g** (t\u1eeb vai tr\xf2 \u0111\u1ebfn h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng) l\xe0 m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed3 th\u1ecb. Trong policy, n\xf3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vi\u1ebft d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng c\xe1c c\u1ea1nh, v\xed d\u1ee5:\\n\\n```csv\\ng, reader, read\\ng, owner, read\\ng, owner, write\\n```\\n\\n:::info\\n**p** l\xe0 m\u1ed9t policy th\xf4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng (\u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c so s\xe1nh b\u1eb1ng `==`). **g** l\xe0 m\u1ed9t quan h\u1ec7 \u0111\u1ed3 th\u1ecb. B\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\xeam nhi\u1ec1u quan h\u1ec7 kh\xe1c b\u1eb1ng h\u1eadu t\u1ed1: **g2**, **g3**, v.v.\\n:::\\n\\n## RBAC ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p {#hierarchical-rbac}\\n\\nTrong RBAC ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p, c\xf3 nhi\u1ec1u **lo\u1ea1i t\xe0i nguy\xean** v\u1edbi c\u01a1 ch\u1ebf k\u1ebf th\u1eeba (v\xed d\u1ee5: Subscription \u2192 ResourceGroup). M\u1ed9t subscription **sub1** c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ee9a c\xe1c resource group **rg1**, **rg2**. T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1, c\xf3 c\xe1c vai tr\xf2/h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng \u1edf c\u1ea5p subscription v\xe0 \u1edf c\u1ea5p resource group, v\u1edbi c\u01a1 ch\u1ebf k\u1ebf th\u1eeba gi\u1eefa ch\xfang. V\xed d\u1ee5, vai tr\xf2 subscription **sub-owner** c\xf3 th\u1ec3 k\u1ebf th\u1eeba xu\u1ed1ng vai tr\xf2 resource-group **rg-owner**: n\u1ebfu t\xf4i c\xf3 **sub-owner** tr\xean **sub1**, v\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, t\xf4i c\xf3 **rg-owner** tr\xean **rg1** v\xe0 **rg2**.\\n\\n### \u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a Model {#model-definition-2}\\n\\nM\u1ed9t m\xf4 h\xecnh RBAC ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u:\\n\\n```toml\\n[request_definition]\\nr = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[policy_definition]\\np = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[role_definition]\\ng = _, _\\ng2 = _, _\\n\\n[policy_effect]\\ne = some(where (p.eft == allow))\\n\\n[matchers]\\nm = r.sub == p.sub && g(p.act, r.act) && g2(p.obj, r.obj)\\n```\\n\\n\u1ede \u0111\xe2y **g** li\xean k\u1ebft c\xe1c vai tr\xf2/h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng v\xe0 **g2** li\xean k\u1ebft c\xe1c t\xe0i nguy\xean (v\xed d\u1ee5: t\u1eeb subscription \u0111\u1ebfn resource group).\\n\\n### Th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m trong Casbin editor {#try-it-in-the-casbin-editor-2}\\n\\nM\u1edf [editor](https://casbin.org/editor) v\xe0 d\xe1n m\xf4 h\xecnh \u1edf tr\xean.\\n\\nD\xe1n n\u1ed9i dung sau v\xe0o **Policy editor**:\\n\\n```csv\\np, alice, sub-reader, sub1\\np, bob, rg-owner, rg2\\n\\n// subscription role to subscription action mapping\\ng, sub-reader, sub-read\\ng, sub-owner, sub-read\\ng, sub-owner, sub-write\\n\\n// resourceGroup role to resourceGroup action mapping\\ng, rg-reader, rg-read\\ng, rg-owner, rg-read\\ng, rg-owner, rg-write\\n\\n// subscription role to resourceGroup role mapping\\ng, sub-reader, rg-reader\\ng, sub-owner, rg-owner\\n\\n// subscription resource to resourceGroup resource mapping\\ng2, sub1, rg1\\ng2, sub2, rg2\\n```\\n\\nV\xe0 d\xe1n n\u1ed9i dung sau v\xe0o **Request editor**:\\n\\n```csv\\nalice, rg-read, rg1\\n```\\n\\nK\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 s\u1ebd l\xe0:\\n\\n```text\\ntrue\\n```\\n\\n### H\xecnh \u1ea3nh tr\u1ef1c quan v\u1ec1 kh\u1edbp gi\u1eefa m\xf4 h\xecnh RBAC, ch\xednh s\xe1ch v\xe0 y\xeau c\u1ea7u {#visual-representation-of-the-rbac-model-policy-and-request-matching-1}\\n\\n![hrbac](/img/tutorial/hrbac.png)\\n\\nC\xe1c c\u1ea1nh **g** (role \u2192 action, role \u2192 role) c\xf3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vi\u1ebft trong policy nh\u01b0 sau:\\n\\n```csv\\n// subscription role to subscription action mapping\\ng, sub-reader, sub-read\\ng, sub-owner, sub-read\\ng, sub-owner, sub-write\\n\\n// resourceGroup role to resourceGroup action mapping\\ng, rg-reader, rg-read\\ng, rg-owner, rg-read\\ng, rg-owner, rg-write\\n\\n// subscription role to resourceGroup role mapping\\ng, sub-reader, rg-reader\\ng, sub-owner, rg-owner\\n```\\n\\nC\xe1c c\u1ea1nh **g2** \xe1nh x\u1ea1 subscription v\u1edbi resource group:\\n\\n```csv\\n// subscription resource to resourceGroup resource mapping\\ng2, sub1, rg1\\ng2, sub2, rg2\\n```\\n\\n#### H\xecnh \u1ea3nh tr\u1ef1c quan v\u1ec1 kh\u1edbp Subject {#subject-matching-visual-representation}\\n\\n![hrbac-sub-match](/img/tutorial/hrbac-sub-match.png)\\n\\n#### H\xecnh \u1ea3nh tr\u1ef1c quan v\u1ec1 kh\u1edbp Action {#action-matching-visual-representation}\\n\\n![hrbac-act-match](/img/tutorial/hrbac-act-match.png)\\n\\n#### H\xecnh \u1ea3nh tr\u1ef1c quan v\u1ec1 kh\u1edbp Object {#object-matching-visual-representation}\\n\\n![hrbac-obj-match](/img/tutorial/hrbac-obj-match.png)\\n\\n:::info\\nCasbin \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 y\xeau c\u1ea7u d\u1ef1a tr\xean t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch. N\u1ebfu \xedt nh\u1ea5t m\u1ed9t ch\xednh s\xe1ch kh\u1edbp, k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 l\xe0 **true**; ng\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea1i l\xe0 **false**.\\n:::\\n\\n## K\u1ebft lu\u1eadn {#conclusion}\\n\\nH\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn n\xe0y \u0111\xe3 ch\u1ec9 ra c\xe1ch bi\u1ec3u di\u1ec5n ACL, RBAC v\xe0 RBAC ph\xe2n c\u1ea5p trong Casbin. Trong ph\u1ea7n ti\u1ebfp theo, ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd tri\u1ec3n khai \u0111i\u1ec1u n\xe0y trong m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Spring Boot v\xe0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 c\xe1c API b\u1eb1ng Casbin."},{"id":"/2021/08/19/apisix-casbin-authorization","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/2021/08/19/apisix-casbin-authorization","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2021-08-19-apisix-casbin-authorization.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2021-08-19-apisix-casbin-authorization.md","title":"\u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n trong APISIX s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Casbin","description":"Th\u1ef1c thi v\xe0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt RBAC c\u1ee7a Casbin tr\xean \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn y\xeau c\u1ea7u APISIX v\u1edbi c\xe1c ki\u1ec3m tra cho ph\xe9p, t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i v\xe0 d\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p c\xf3 th\u1ec3 t\xe1i t\u1ea1o.","date":"2021-08-19T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":6.06,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Rushikesh Tote","title":"Member of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/rushitote","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/rushitote.png","key":"rushitote","page":null},{"name":"Yilia Lin","title":"Apache APISIX Committer","url":"https://github.com/Yilialinn","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114121331?v=4","key":"yilialin","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"\u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n trong APISIX s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Casbin","description":"Th\u1ef1c thi v\xe0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt RBAC c\u1ee7a Casbin tr\xean \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn y\xeau c\u1ea7u APISIX v\u1edbi c\xe1c ki\u1ec3m tra cho ph\xe9p, t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i v\xe0 d\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p c\xf3 th\u1ec3 t\xe1i t\u1ea1o.","authors":["rushitote","yilialin"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Hi\u1ec3u chi ti\u1ebft c\xe1ch ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u1edbp c\u1ee7a Casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/2023/12/08/understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail"},"nextItem":{"title":"Yang Luo \u2014 Ng\u01b0\u1eddi chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng \u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf Google (Google Open Source Peer Bonus)","permalink":"/vi/blog/2020/04/21/google-award"}},"content":"## Gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u {#introduction}\\n\\n[Apache APISIX](https://apisix.apache.org/) c\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c thi c\xe1c ch\xednh s\xe1ch \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a Casbin\\nt\u1ea1i gateway b\u1eb1ng plugin t\xedch h\u1ee3p s\u1eb5n\\n[`authz-casbin`](https://apisix.apache.org/docs/apisix/plugins/authz-casbin/).\\nPlugin n\xe0y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng\\n[Lua Casbin](https://github.com/apache/casbin-lua-casbin) v\xe0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\xe1c m\xf4 h\xecnh ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t truy c\u1eadp\\nnh\u01b0 ACL, RBAC v\xe0 ABAC.\\n\\nH\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn n\xe0y \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1ed9t ch\xednh s\xe1ch RBAC nh\u1ecf l\xean \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn y\xeau c\u1ea7u APISIX. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd x\xe1c minh\\nc\xe1c y\xeau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe9p v\xe0 b\u1ecb t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i, sau \u0111\xf3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt m\u1ed9t ch\xednh s\xe1ch chung th\xf4ng qua\\nmetadata c\u1ee7a plugin m\xe0 kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n thay \u0111\u1ed5i route.\\n\\nC\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng Casbin ban \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t t\xedch h\u1ee3p n\xe0y trong\\n[APISIX Issue #4674](https://github.com/apache/apisix/issues/4674), v\xe0\\n[APISIX PR #4710](https://github.com/apache/apisix/pull/4710) \u0111\xe3 th\xeam plugin.\\n\\n:::info C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\xe1ng 8 n\u0103m 2026\\n\\nH\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn n\xe0y \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt v\xe0o th\xe1ng 8 n\u0103m 2026. C\xe1c v\xed d\u1ee5 \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\xe1c minh v\u1edbi\\nApache APISIX 3.17.0. T\xe1c gi\u1ea3 g\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a n\u0103m 2021 v\u1eabn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghi nh\u1eadn, v\xe0 Yilia Lin\\n\u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\xeam v\xe0o cho l\u1ea7n c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt n\u0103m 2026.\\n\\n:::\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n:::warning Ranh gi\u1edbi x\xe1c th\u1ef1c\\n\\nCasbin th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n, kh\xf4ng ph\u1ea3i x\xe1c th\u1ef1c. V\xed d\u1ee5 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ti\xeau \u0111\u1ec1 y\xeau c\u1ea7u `user`\\nl\xe0m ch\u1ee7 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef b\xe0i ki\u1ec3m tra \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n. Trong m\xf4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t, \u0111\u1eebng tin t\u01b0\u1edfng\\nm\u1ed9t ti\xeau \u0111\u1ec1 danh t\xednh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cung c\u1ea5p tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp b\u1edfi client. M\u1ed9t l\u1edbp x\xe1c th\u1ef1c ho\u1eb7c proxy\\n\u0111\xe1ng tin c\u1eady n\xean thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp danh t\xednh v\xe0 x\xf3a ho\u1eb7c ghi \u0111\xe8 c\xe1c gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb kh\xf4ng \u0111\xe1ng tin c\u1eady tr\u01b0\u1edbc\\nkhi Casbin \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 y\xeau c\u1ea7u.\\n\\n:::\\n\\n## \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ti\xean quy\u1ebft v\xe0 tr\u1ea1ng th\xe1i b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u {#prerequisites-and-starting-state}\\n\\nH\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn n\xe0y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t phi\xean b\u1ea3n Apache APISIX 3.17.0 d\xf9ng m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n \u0111\xe3\\nch\u1ea1y s\u1eb5n. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t phi\xean b\u1ea3n c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9, h\xe3y l\xe0m theo\\n[h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn tri\u1ec3n khai APISIX Docker](https://apisix.apache.org/docs/docker/manual/)\\nv\xe0 ghim image APISIX th\xe0nh `apache/apisix:3.17.0-debian`.\\n\\nPhi\xean b\u1ea3n ph\u1ea3i c\xf3:\\n\\n- m\u1eb7t ph\u1eb3ng d\u1eef li\u1ec7u kh\u1ea3 d\u1ee5ng t\u1ea1i `http://127.0.0.1:9080`;\\n- API **Admin** c\xf3 s\u1eb5n t\u1ea1i `http://127.0.0.1:9180`;\\n- c\xe1c plugin t\xedch h\u1ee3p s\u1eb5n `authz-casbin` v\xe0 `mocking` \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1eadt.\\n\\nB\u1ea1n c\u0169ng c\u1ea7n `curl` v\xe0 `jq`. \u0110\u1eb7t `admin_key` th\xe0nh kh\xf3a \u0111\xe3 c\u1ea5u h\xecnh cho\\nAPI **Admin**:\\n\\n```sh\\nexport admin_key=\'<your-admin-api-key>\'\\n```\\n\\nThay th\u1ebf gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb gi\u1eef ch\u1ed7 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c. X\xe1c nh\u1eadn r\u1eb1ng API **Admin**\\nc\xf3 th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\xe0 plugin \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1eadt:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/plugins/list\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" | \\\\\\njq -e \'([\\"authz-casbin\\", \\"mocking\\"] - .) | length == 0\'\\n```\\n\\nL\u1ec7nh n\xean in ra `true`. Kh\xf4ng c\xf4ng khai API **Admin** tr\xean m\u1ea1ng kh\xf4ng \u0111\xe1ng tin\\nc\u1eady ho\u1eb7c t\xe1i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\xf4ng tin \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp demo trong m\xf4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng kh\xe1c.\\n\\n## \u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a model v\xe0 policy {#define-the-model-and-policy}\\n\\nPlugin \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 ba gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb y\xeau c\u1ea7u:\\n\\n- `sub`: \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1eeb header y\xeau c\u1ea7u \u0111\xe3 c\u1ea5u h\xecnh;\\n- `obj`: \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn URI c\u1ee7a y\xeau c\u1ea7u; v\xe0\\n- `act`: ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c HTTP.\\n\\nT\u1ea1o `model.conf`:\\n\\n```ini\\n[request_definition]\\nr = sub, obj, act\\n\\n[policy_definition]\\np = sub, obj, act\\n\\n[role_definition]\\ng = _, _\\n\\n[policy_effect]\\ne = some(where (p.eft == allow))\\n\\n[matchers]\\nm = (g(r.sub, p.sub) || keyMatch(r.sub, p.sub)) && keyMatch(r.obj, p.obj) && keyMatch(r.act, p.act)\\n```\\n\\nT\u1ea1o `policy.csv`:\\n\\n```csv\\np, *, /anything, GET\\np, admin, *, *\\ng, alice, admin\\n```\\n\\nPolicy n\xe0y cho ph\xe9p b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\xe0o g\u1eedi `GET /anything`. N\xf3 c\u0169ng g\xe1n\\nvai tr\xf2 `admin` cho `alice`, vai tr\xf2 n\xe0y c\xf3 th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp m\u1ecdi \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn v\u1edbi m\u1ecdi ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c.\\n\\n## L\u01b0u tr\u1eef policy chung trong metadata c\u1ee7a plugin {#store-the-shared-policy-in-plugin-metadata}\\n\\nN\u1ea1p c\xe1c t\u1ec7p d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng chu\u1ed7i JSON v\xe0 ghi ch\xfang v\xe0o metadata c\u1ee7a plugin APISIX:\\n\\n```sh\\njq -n \\\\\\n  --rawfile model model.conf \\\\\\n  --rawfile policy policy.csv \\\\\\n  \'{model: $model, policy: $policy}\' | \\\\\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/plugin_metadata/authz-casbin\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"Content-Type: application/json\\" \\\\\\n  -X PUT \\\\\\n  --data-binary @-\\n```\\n\\nMetadata c\u1ee7a plugin cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t model v\xe0 policy cho c\xe1c route b\u1eadt\\n`authz-casbin` m\xe0 kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a model v\xe0 policy c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 ri\xeang.\\n\\n## B\u1eadt \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n tr\xean m\u1ed9t route {#enable-authorization-on-a-route}\\n\\nT\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t route v\xe0 ch\u1ec9 th\u1ecb cho plugin \u0111\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1eeb header `user`:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/routes/casbin-demo\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"Content-Type: application/json\\" \\\\\\n  -X PUT \\\\\\n  -d \'{\\n    \\"uri\\": \\"/*\\",\\n    \\"plugins\\": {\\n      \\"authz-casbin\\": {\\n        \\"username\\": \\"user\\"\\n      },\\n      \\"mocking\\": {\\n        \\"_meta\\": {\\n          \\"priority\\": 1000\\n        },\\n        \\"response_status\\": 200,\\n        \\"response_example\\": \\"{\\\\\\"message\\\\\\":\\\\\\"authorized\\\\\\"}\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\"upstream\\": {\\n      \\"type\\": \\"roundrobin\\",\\n      \\"nodes\\": {\\n        \\"127.0.0.1:1\\": 1\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\'\\n```\\n\\nRoute s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng model v\xe0 policy t\u1eeb metadata c\u1ee7a plugin v\xec n\xf3 ch\u1ec9\\n\u0111\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a tr\u01b0\u1eddng `username` c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9. Model v\xe0 policy c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 c\u1ee7a route, khi\\n\u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea5u h\xecnh, s\u1ebd \u01b0u ti\xean h\u01a1n metadata c\u1ee7a plugin.\\n\\nPlugin `mocking` cung c\u1ea5p ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh cho c\xe1c y\xeau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe9p,\\n\u0111\u1ec3 v\xed d\u1ee5 kh\xf4ng ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\xe0o upstream c\xf4ng khai. \u0110\u1ed9 \u01b0u ti\xean c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 c\u1ee7a route\\nth\u1ea5p h\u01a1n `authz-casbin`, \u0111i\u1ec1u n\xe0y l\xe0m cho quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n ch\u1ea1y tr\u01b0\u1edbc.\\nUpstream kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp do \u0111\xf3 kh\xf4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c li\xean h\u1ec7. Ghi \u0111\xe8 \u0111\u1ed9 \u01b0u ti\xean n\xe0y\\nv\xe0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i mock l\xe0 c\xe1c fixture ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed, kh\xf4ng ph\u1ea3i khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb cho production.\\n\\n## X\xe1c minh c\xe1c quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh cho ph\xe9p v\xe0 t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i {#verify-allow-and-deny-decisions}\\n\\nY\xeau c\u1ea7u \u1ea9n danh \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn c\xf4ng khai \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cho ph\xe9p:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:9080/anything\\n```\\n\\nTr\u1ea1ng th\xe1i mong \u0111\u1ee3i:\\n\\n```text\\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\\n{\\"message\\":\\"authorized\\"}\\n```\\n\\n`bob` kh\xf4ng c\xf3 vai tr\xf2 `admin`, v\xec v\u1eady m\u1ed9t \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn kh\xe1c b\u1ecb t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:9080/anything/res -H \'user: bob\'\\n```\\n\\nK\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 mong \u0111\u1ee3i:\\n\\n```text\\nHTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\\n{\\"message\\":\\"Access Denied\\"}\\n```\\n\\n`alice` c\xf3 vai tr\xf2 `admin`, v\xec v\u1eady c\xf9ng y\xeau c\u1ea7u \u0111\xf3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cho ph\xe9p:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:9080/anything/res -H \'user: alice\'\\n```\\n\\nTr\u1ea1ng th\xe1i mong \u0111\u1ee3i:\\n\\n```text\\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\\n{\\"message\\":\\"authorized\\"}\\n```\\n\\n## C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt policy chung {#update-the-shared-policy}\\n\\nTh\xeam quy\u1ec1n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp cho `bob` v\xe0o `policy.csv`:\\n\\n```csv\\np, *, /anything, GET\\np, admin, *, *\\np, bob, /anything/res, GET\\ng, alice, admin\\n```\\n\\nCh\u1ea1y l\u1ea1i l\u1ec7nh metadata c\u1ee7a plugin. C\xe1c route tham chi\u1ebfu metadata n\xe0y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng\\npolicy \u0111\xe3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt m\xe0 kh\xf4ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i c\u1ea5u h\xecnh route. L\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i y\xeau c\u1ea7u:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:9080/anything/res -H \'user: bob\'\\n```\\n\\nK\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 mong \u0111\u1ee3i b\xe2y gi\u1edd l\xe0:\\n\\n```text\\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\\n{\\"message\\":\\"authorized\\"}\\n```\\n\\n## Ch\u1ecdn ph\u1ea1m vi c\u1ea5u h\xecnh {#choosing-the-configuration-scope}\\n\\nS\u1eed d\u1ee5ng metadata c\u1ee7a plugin khi nhi\u1ec1u route n\xean chia s\u1ebb m\u1ed9t model v\xe0 policy. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng\\nmodel v\xe0 policy c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 c\u1ee7a route khi m\u1ed9t route c\u1ea7n h\xecnh th\u1ee9c \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp. \u0110\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft schema c\u1ea5u h\xecnh \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 v\xe0 gi\u1ea3i ph\xe1p thay th\u1ebf d\u1ef1a tr\xean t\u1ec7p, xem\\n[t\xe0i li\u1ec7u tham kh\u1ea3o plugin `authz-casbin` c\u1ee7a APISIX](https://apisix.apache.org/docs/apisix/plugins/authz-casbin/).\\n\\n## D\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p {#clean-up}\\n\\nX\xf3a route ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/routes/casbin-demo\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" \\\\\\n  -X DELETE\\n```\\n\\nX\xf3a metadata plugin chung:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/plugin_metadata/authz-casbin\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" \\\\\\n  -X DELETE\\n```"},{"id":"/2020/04/21/google-award","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/2020/04/21/google-award","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2020-04-21-google-award.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2020-04-21-google-award.md","title":"Yang Luo \u2014 Ng\u01b0\u1eddi chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng \u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf Google (Google Open Source Peer Bonus)","description":"Ch\xfang t\xf4i vui m\u1eebng th\xf4ng b\xe1o r\u1eb1ng nh\xe0 s\xe1ng l\u1eadp c\u1ee7a Casbin, Yang Luo, \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vinh danh l\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng \u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf Google cho nh\u1eefng \u0111\xf3ng g\xf3p c\u1ee7a \xf4ng v\xe0o Casbin, Npcap v\xe0 Nmap trong qu\xfd 3 n\u0103m 2019.","date":"2020-04-21T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":1.2,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Casbin","title":"Official Account","url":"https://github.com/casbin","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/casbin.png","key":"casbin","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Yang Luo \u2014 Ng\u01b0\u1eddi chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng \u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf Google (Google Open Source Peer Bonus)","authors":["casbin"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"\u1ee6y quy\u1ec1n trong APISIX s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/2021/08/19/apisix-casbin-authorization"},"nextItem":{"title":"T\xe1i c\u1ea5u tr\xfac t\xe0i li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i","permalink":"/vi/blog/2018/09/23/new-website"}},"content":"Ch\xfang t\xf4i vui m\u1eebng th\xf4ng b\xe1o r\u1eb1ng nh\xe0 s\xe1ng l\u1eadp c\u1ee7a Casbin, [Yang Luo](https://github.com/hsluoyz), \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vinh danh l\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng [Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng \u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf Google](https://opensource.google.com/docs/growing/peer-bonus/) cho nh\u1eefng \u0111\xf3ng g\xf3p c\u1ee7a \xf4ng v\xe0o [Casbin](/), [Npcap](https://nmap.org/npcap/) v\xe0 [Nmap](https://nmap.org/) trong qu\xfd 3 n\u0103m 2019.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n![ospb](/img/blog/google-open-source-peer-bonus-award-letter.png)\\n\\n> Th\u01b0 trao gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\xf3 s\u1eb5n [t\u1ea1i \u0111\xe2y](https://github.com/hsluoyz/hsluoyz.github.io/blob/master/download/Open%20Source%20Peer%20Bonus%20Q3%202019%20-%20Yang%20Luo%20-%20OSPB%20Award%20Letter.pdf).\\n\\nGoogle m\xf4 t\u1ea3 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh nh\u01b0 sau:\\n\\n> _Gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng \u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Google (Google Peer Bonus) ghi nh\u1eadn m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Google \u0111\xe3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t xa k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng, Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng \u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf (Open Source Peer Bonus) ghi nh\u1eadn nh\u1eefng c\u1ed9ng t\xe1c vi\xean b\xean ngo\xe0i \u0111\xe3 c\xf3 nh\u1eefng \u0111\xf3ng g\xf3p xu\u1ea5t s\u1eafc cho m\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf._\\n\\n[Th\xf4ng b\xe1o v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng n\u0103m 2019](https://opensource.googleblog.com/2020/01/announcing-2019-second-cycle-google.html) li\u1ec7t k\xea Yang v\xe0 Casbin c\xf9ng v\u1edbi c\xe1c d\u1ef1 \xe1n v\xe0 nh\xe0 ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n c\xf3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng kh\xe1c, bao g\u1ed3m Git, TensorFlow, V8, CPython, LLVM, c\xe1c d\u1ef1 \xe1n Apache, Angular v\xe0 Jenkins.\\n\\nCh\xfang t\xf4i t\u1ef1 h\xe0o khi th\u1ea5y Casbin \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\xf4ng nh\u1eadn v\xec nh\u1eefng n\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c m\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf v\xe0 b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt \u0111\xe1m m\xe2y.\\n\\n_C\u1ea3m \u01a1n b\u1ea1n \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\xe0nh c\xf9ng Casbin!_"},{"id":"/2018/09/23/new-website","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/2018/09/23/new-website","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-09-23-new-website.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-09-23-new-website.md","title":"T\xe1i c\u1ea5u tr\xfac t\xe0i li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i","description":"Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 di chuy\u1ec3n t\xe0i li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a Casbin t\u1eeb GitHub Wiki sang ph\u1ea7n Docs tr\xean trang web n\xe0y, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cung c\u1ea5p b\u1edfi Docusaurus. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\xf3 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb Markdown t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n, t\xecm ki\u1ebfm to\xe0n v\u0103n, qu\u1ea3n l\xfd phi\xean b\u1ea3n v\xe0 d\u1ecbch thu\u1eadt.","date":"2018-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.37,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Creator of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/hsluoyz.png","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"T\xe1i c\u1ea5u tr\xfac t\xe0i li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i","authors":["hsluoyz"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Yang Luo \u2014 Ng\u01b0\u1eddi chi\u1ebfn th\u1eafng Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng \u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p Ngu\u1ed3n m\u1edf Google (Google Open Source Peer Bonus)","permalink":"/vi/blog/2020/04/21/google-award"},"nextItem":{"title":"node-Casbin: Th\xe0nh vi\xean m\u1edbi c\u1ee7a gia \u0111\xecnh Casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/2018/08/27/node-casbin"}},"content":"Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 di chuy\u1ec3n t\xe0i li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a Casbin t\u1eeb GitHub Wiki sang ph\u1ea7n **Docs** tr\xean trang web n\xe0y, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cung c\u1ea5p b\u1edfi Docusaurus. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\xf3 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb Markdown t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n, t\xecm ki\u1ebfm to\xe0n v\u0103n, qu\u1ea3n l\xfd phi\xean b\u1ea3n v\xe0 d\u1ecbch thu\u1eadt.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nT\xe0i li\u1ec7u v\u1eabn \u0111ang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n. M\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n trang web c\xf3 tr\xean GitHub: https://github.com/apache/casbin-website\\n\\n\u0110\xf3ng g\xf3p v\xe0 g\u1ee3i \xfd \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hoan ngh\xeanh."},{"id":"/2018/08/27/node-casbin","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/2018/08/27/node-casbin","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-08-27-node-casbin.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-08-27-node-casbin.md","title":"node-Casbin: Th\xe0nh vi\xean m\u1edbi c\u1ee7a gia \u0111\xecnh Casbin","description":"Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i Casbin sang Node.js: node-Casbin.","date":"2018-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.42,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Zixuan Liu","title":"Casbin Maintainer","url":"https://github.com/nodece","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/nodece.png","key":"nodece","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"node-Casbin: Th\xe0nh vi\xean m\u1edbi c\u1ee7a gia \u0111\xecnh Casbin","authors":["nodece"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"T\xe1i c\u1ea5u tr\xfac t\xe0i li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i","permalink":"/vi/blog/2018/09/23/new-website"},"nextItem":{"title":"Casbin Server \u0111\xe3 ra m\u1eaft!","permalink":"/vi/blog/2018/08/07/launching-casbin-server"}},"content":"Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i Casbin sang Node.js: [node-Casbin](https://github.com/apache/casbin-node-casbin).\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n**node-Casbin** gi\u1eef nguy\xean c\xe1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\xe0 API gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 c\xe1c phi\xean b\u1ea3n tri\u1ec3n khai Casbin kh\xe1c. C\xe1c middleware cho Express, Koa2 v\xe0 Egg.js \u0111\xe3 c\xf3 s\u1eb5n, v\xe0 m\u1ed9t adapter l\u01b0u tr\u1eef Sequelize c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bao g\u1ed3m.\\n\\nCh\xfang t\xf4i hy v\u1ecdng n\xf3 ph\xf9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi stack c\xf4ng ngh\u1ec7 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i v\xe0 \u0111\xf3ng g\xf3p \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hoan ngh\xeanh.\\n\\nGitHub: https://github.com/apache/casbin-node-casbin"},{"id":"/2018/08/07/launching-casbin-server","metadata":{"permalink":"/vi/blog/2018/08/07/launching-casbin-server","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-08-07-launching-casbin-server.md","source":"@site/i18n/vi/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-08-07-launching-casbin-server.md","title":"Casbin Server \u0111\xe3 ra m\u1eaft!","description":"M\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ecfi li\u1ec7u Casbin c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ea1y d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 thay v\xec th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n hay kh\xf4ng. C\xe2u tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi l\xe0 c\xf3. Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 ra m\u1eaft Casbin Server nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea3i ph\xe1p c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 cho Access Control as a Service.","date":"2018-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.76,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Helong Zhang","title":"Casbin Maintainer","url":"https://github.com/BetaCat0","imageURL":"/vi/img/authors/BetaCat0.png","key":"BetaCat0","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Casbin Server \u0111\xe3 ra m\u1eaft!","authors":["BetaCat0"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"node-Casbin: Th\xe0nh vi\xean m\u1edbi c\u1ee7a gia \u0111\xecnh Casbin","permalink":"/vi/blog/2018/08/27/node-casbin"}},"content":"M\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ecfi li\u1ec7u Casbin c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ea1y d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 thay v\xec th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n hay kh\xf4ng. C\xe2u tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi l\xe0 **c\xf3**. Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 ra m\u1eaft [Casbin Server](https://github.com/apache/casbin-server) nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea3i ph\xe1p c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 cho **Access Control as a Service**.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n**Casbin Server** \u0111ang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 c\u1ed1t l\xf5i ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n t\xedch c\u1ef1c. C\xe1c t\xednh n\u0103ng hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i:\\n\\n- \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c vi\u1ebft b\u1eb1ng Go.\\n- Qu\u1ea3n l\xfd nhi\u1ec1u phi\xean b\u1ea3n Casbin \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eadp trung h\xf3a vi\u1ec7c th\u1ef1c thi ch\xednh s\xe1ch t\u1eeb nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5.\\n- **gRPC** cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 giao ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi client; h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 **REST** s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed5 sung trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai.\\n- Giao di\u1ec7n qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb web \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3n l\xfd c\xe1c phi\xean b\u1ea3n, m\xf4 h\xecnh, l\u01b0u tr\u1eef ch\xednh s\xe1ch v\xe0 c\xe2n b\u1eb1ng t\u1ea3i.\\n\\nM\xe3 ngu\u1ed3n: https://github.com/apache/casbin-server\\n\\nC\xe1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 (issues) v\xe0 y\xeau c\u1ea7u k\xe9o (pull requests) \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hoan ngh\xeanh."}]}}')}}]);